From: Shayne Legault <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:46:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] kboot: forward proximity calibration for touchscreen aliases

N61 Gen1 firmware optionally uses its per-unit proximity calibration in
addition to the required multi-touch calibration. Copy it through the
existing touchscreen0 alias path and keep the same missing/syscfg-reference
handling as the other calibration providers. The firmware container names
the property at runtime; no unit-specific bytes enter the shared recipe.

---
diff --git a/src/kboot.c b/src/kboot.c
--- a/src/kboot.c
+++ b/src/kboot.c
@@ -932,6 +932,7 @@
         {"firefly-p100-calibration", "apple,z2-firefly-p100-cal-blob"},
         {"ext-multi-touch-calibration", "apple,z2-ext-cal-blob"},
         {"pressure-effect-correction", "apple,z2-pressure-cal-blob"},
+        {"prox-calibration", "apple,z2-prox-cal-blob"},
     };
     const char *path = fdt_get_alias(dt, "touchscreen0");
     if (path == NULL)
